    "detailed_description": "Fight incoming waves in this classic <strong>pixel-art arcade</strong> game! Put your top-tier aiming skills to the test, get rewarded, and trade up your ammo to defeat the final boss.<br><br>Don't be fooled by MoonRun's simple aesthetic and pace; it requires a skilled player to make it all the way to the end, so good luck, and have fun out there!<br><br>MoonRun is pure arcade nostalgia-bait with perfectly crafted pixel art goodness, to give it that undeniable taste of a <strong>retro</strong> classic. We invite you to lace up and find out exactly kind of threat we are under and help defend our hard earned resources",
